Fill a #tumbler{} with ice up 1/4 of the way in the cup.

Add @pear nectar{2%ounce} and @Crown Royal or Rye Whiskey{1%ounce}.

Top up with @ginger ale{2%ounce}.

Stir well.

Decorate with two thinly sliced @pear{1}(for decoration, optional) wedges.
